cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the curated dataset, please cite both the paper and this repository."
title: "genmed-impact / denominator: a genetic-disease × genetic-medicine impact library and reproducible burden pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline and interactive webapp that derive the global burden of serious
  genetic disease and the comparative impact of existing interventions (carrier screening,
  IVF + preimplantation genetic testing, prenatal diagnosis, newborn screening, and existing
  somatic therapies) versus germline embryo editing. The core deliverable is a structured
  library of serious genetic diseases mapped to their causal genes and to each intervention,
  with Monte-Carlo uncertainty and an explicitly isolated germline-editing residual.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/alethicresearch/genmed-impact"
url: "https://github.com/alethicresearch/genmed-impact"
version: "0.1.0"
# TODO(authors): set the release date at tag time.
